{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:BringsSurface.UnitParticleState","@type":"LeanModule","name":"BringsSurface.UnitParticleState","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.CategoryTheory.Monoidal.Category","lean:module:Mathlib.CategoryTheory.Category.Basic"],"declarations":12,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.UnitParticleState.unique_generator","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.UnitParticleState.unique_generator","kind":"theorem","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/unit-particle-state.lean#L62-L62","doc":"Uniqueness: the hom-space 𝟙 → H¹_{𝔪₁}(A) is at most\none-dimensional. In a monoidal category this means any two\nglobal sections of the cohomology object are equal (the\ngenerator is essentially unique, not merely up to scalar). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.UnitParticleState.q_diff_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.UnitParticleState.q_diff_eq","kind":"theorem","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/unit-particle-state.lean#L57-L57","doc":"The defining ODE: d_q ∘ incl(Li_q) = (log_q)⁻¹ ∘ incl(Li_q). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.UnitParticleState.logq_inv_spec","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.UnitParticleState.logq_inv_spec","kind":"theorem","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/unit-particle-state.lean#L55-L55","doc":"logq and logq_inv are mutual inverses (on the image of incl). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.UnitParticleState.logq_inv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.UnitParticleState.logq_inv","kind":"def","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/unit-particle-state.lean#L53-L53","doc":"The q-differential equation: d_q Li_q = dz / log_q(z).\nExpressed categorically: applying d_q after embedding Li_q into A\nequals applying the reciprocal q-logarithm (log_q)⁻¹.\nHere `logq_inv` encodes the morphism (log_q)⁻¹ : A → A. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.UnitParticleState.incl","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.UnitParticleState.incl","kind":"def","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/unit-particle-state.lean#L48-L48","doc":"The inclusion of the cohomology into A (for stating the ODE). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.UnitParticleState.generator","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.UnitParticleState.generator","kind":"def","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/unit-particle-state.lean#L46-L46","doc":"The generator morphism Li_q : 𝟙 → H¹_{𝔪₁}(A). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.UnitParticleState.logq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.UnitParticleState.logq","kind":"def","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/unit-particle-state.lean#L44-L44","doc":"The q-logarithm morphism log_q : A → A. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.UnitParticleState.dq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.UnitParticleState.dq","kind":"def","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/unit-particle-state.lean#L42-L42","doc":"The Jackson q-derivative endomorphism d_q : A → A. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.UnitParticleState.cohomObj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.UnitParticleState.cohomObj","kind":"def","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/unit-particle-state.lean#L40-L40","doc":"The local cohomology object H¹_{𝔪₁}(A). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.UnitParticleState.substrate","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.UnitParticleState.substrate","kind":"def","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/unit-particle-state.lean#L38-L38","doc":"The substrate algebra object A. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.UnitParticleState.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.UnitParticleState.mk","kind":"ctor","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/unit-particle-state.lean#L35-L35","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.UnitParticleState","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.UnitParticleState","kind":"structure","line":27,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/unit-particle-state.lean#L27-L63","doc":"**UnitParticleState**: the fundamental generator Li_q(z) of the\nlocal cohomology group H¹_{𝔪₁}(A).\n\nThis is the unique (up to scalar) element satisfying the\nq-differential equation d_q Li_q(z) = dz / log_q(z), where d_q\nis the Jackson q-derivative.\n\nLaTeX: `\\label{def:unit-particle-state}` ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:unit-particle-state","label":"def:unit-particle-state","md":"quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/unit-particle-state.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}